  "details": "Eyes and Eylids are grouped together on the same control channel in the SDK, the way that native eye tracking for vrchat currently works only lets users blink both of their eyes at once which is a bit limited for some users. \n\nIf Eyes and Eyelids were separate we could use VRChats native eye tracking control in conjunction with a custom blinking solution that lets us control our eyelids independently.",
